## Authentication

The provider authenticates with an Admiral API key. Create one in the Admiral
console or with the [Admiral CLI](https://github.com/admiral-io/admiral-cli),
then pass it through the environment rather than writing it into
configuration:

```shell
export ADMIRAL_API_KEY="admp_..."
```

The `api_key` argument takes precedence over `ADMIRAL_API_KEY` when both are
set. The provider connects to `api.admiral.io:443` unless `server` or
`ADMIRAL_SERVER` names another host.

